<report>
<title>@method multiple comparisons</title>

<p>Critical value (Studentized range) = @{q:roundu},  |q<sup>*</sup>| = @{d:roundu}<br />
Pooled standard deviation = @{psd:roundu}</p>

<table>
<tr><th>Comparison</th><th>Mean difference L <ci>(@{pc:round2}% CI)</ci></th><th>q</th><th></th></tr>
<block name="differences"><tr><td>@cf1 vs. @cf2</td><td>@{delta:roundu} <ci>(@{lci:roundu}  to  @{uci:roundu})</ci></td><td>@{t:roundu}</td><td><pval>@{p:pval}@{stop_marker}</pval></td></tr></block>
</table>

<table>
<tr><th>Variable</th><th>Mean</th><th>Significant contrasts</th></tr>
<block name="summary"><tr><td>@cf1</td><td>@{mean:roundu}</td><td>@sigs</td></tr></block>
</table>
</report>
